From 7f5ad970eab6117e287cfdd6dfce74e852a8b355 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "nipuna.dulara" <pererannd.21@uom.lk>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:05:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] nr: Fix energy-accounting correctness across all three
 models

Correct several accounting bugs found while exercising the models: the
UE energy source was not updated before a power-state switch, and
NrGnbEnergyModel was double-counting each slot in GetTotalEnergyJ. Cite
TR 38.840 Table 18/20 and take the FR2 power values from Table 20, and
derive the UE reference Rx-antenna count from FreqRange (Table 21)
instead of assuming FR1. On the DRX side, charge Table 19
sleep-transition energy on sleep entry, gate light sleep on the Table
19 transition time, add named TR 38.840 8.2 reference configurations,
and fix the inactivity timer sleeping the UE mid-onDuration.
---
 model/nr-gnb-energy-model.cc |  18 +++++-
 model/nr-gnb-energy-model.h  |   4 +-
 model/nr-ue-drx-model.cc     |  84 +++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 model/nr-ue-drx-model.h      |  41 +++++++++++++-
 model/nr-ue-energy-model.cc  | 106 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 model/nr-ue-energy-model.h   |  16 ++++++
 6 files changed, 238 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

